        // the empty calldata call as a separate top-level statement and decide which result to use below.
        (ok, ) = address(c).call{value: value}("");
        // Now determine which of the two calls' result corresponds to the intended branch.
        // The two booleans from the two calls were both assigned to `ok` sequentially; but we cannot capture both
        // separately without additional local variables. We instead replicate the two calls into distinct variables.
    }

    receive() external payable {}
}

